      "writtenOn": "2023-07-18T12:23:37Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "No. This is the remote device metadata that is about to be used for enabling the stream or metadata update procedure. It is derived from the local metadata in `DirectionalRealignMetadataAudioContexts()`, which based on the local metadata, returns the remote device contexts pair - this is where, the local sink context is set as a remote device source context, then contexts are aligned for both directions when bidirectional scenarios are used. This was the initial remote contexts pair generation.\n\nThen this function processes the remote device contexts further by applying the additional context mixing policy and the UNSPECIFIED context policy.",
